<div class="cloud-page">
    <!-- Email Sent Confirmation Cloud -->
    <div class="login-cloud">
        <h1>{{{form_h1}}}</h1>
        <p>{{{form_p}}}</p>

        {{#if error_message}}
            {{#ifNotEquals error_message ""}}
            <div class="error-alert">
                {{error_message}}
            </div>
            {{/ifNotEquals}}
        {{/if}}

        <div class="login-content">
            <div class="login-form">
                <h2>Email Sent!</h2>
                <p>You should shortly receive email instructions explaining what to do next. If you don't receive this mail, please check your spam folder, and failing that come back here and try again, or contact support.</p>
                
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <a href="/account/login" class="google-btn">Back to Login</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="welcome-text">
                <h2>Check Your Email</h2>
                <p>We've sent password reset instructions to your email address. Follow the link in the email to create a new password for your account.</p>
                <p>The reset link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons. If you don't receive the email, please check your spam folder first.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Information Section -->
    <div class="info-section">
        <div class="info-column">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-clock" style="color: #87CEEB;"></i> Reset Link Expiry</h3>
            <p>Your password reset link will expire after 24 hours for security purposes. If the link expires, you can request a new one at any time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-column">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-envelope-open" style="color: #137DA4;"></i> Check Your Email</h3>
            <p>Don't see the email? Check your spam or junk folder. The email will come from our CloudViPER system with the subject "Password Reset Request".</p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-column">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-life-ring" style="color: #20B2AA;"></i> Still Need Help?</h3>
            <p>If you continue to have issues with password reset, please contact our support team. We're here to help you regain access to your account safely.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>